section-tag\">Service Plans</p>\n      <h2>订阅方案</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\">选择适合你的流量配额与在线设备数。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"plans-stack\">\n      <article class=\"plan-card\">\n        <div class=\"plan-head\">\n          <h3 class=\"plan-name\">基础版</h3>\n          <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n            <span class=\"price-main\">¥15/月</span>\n            <span class=\"price-sub\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n          <li>每月 100GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n          <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"plan-footer\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-select\">选购基础版</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"plan-card featured\">\n        <span class=\"badge\">推荐配置</span>\n        <div class=\"plan-head\">\n          <h3 class=\"plan-name\">旗舰版</h3>\n          <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n            <span class=\"price-main\">¥35/月</span>\n            <span class=\"price-sub\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n          <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n          <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n          <li>7x24 优先工单支持</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"plan-footer\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-select\">选购旗舰版</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"plan-card\">\n        <div class=\"plan-head\">\n          <h3 class=\"plan-name\">团队版</h3>\n          <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n            <span class=\"price-main\">¥85/月</span>\n            <span class=\"price-sub\">按年付仅需 ¥850/年</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <ul class=\"plan-features\">\n          <li>每月 1000GB 极速流量</li>\n          <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n          <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n          <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n          <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"plan-footer\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-select\">选购团队版</a>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"setup\">\n    <div class=\"section-header\">\n      <p class=\"section-tag\">Quick Start</p>\n      <h2>使用步骤</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\">三步完成节点订阅与协议托管。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"setup-grid\">\n      <div class=\"setup-card\">\n        <div class=\"setup-num\">STEP 01</div>\n        <h4>获取订阅链接</h4>\n        <p>在个人中心选择已启用的方案，复制专属订阅托管地址或配置参数。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"setup-card\">\n        <div class=\"setup-num\">STEP 02</div>\n        <h4>导入支持客户端</h4>\n        <p>粘贴链接至对应平台的网络工具中，同步获取最新节点列表与规则。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"setup-card\">\n        <div class=\"setup-num\">STEP 03</div>\n        <h4>启用分流策略</h4>\n        <p>选择推荐节点并开启自动分流模式，按需分配国内外流量走向。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"clients\">\n    <div class=\"section-header\">\n      <p class=\"section-tag\">Compatibility</p>\n      <h2>软件生态</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\">支持常见平台主流内核与协议规则。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"client-box\">\n      <p>云画支持通用网络代理协议，可配合常见第三方开源客户端直接导入配置，包含桌面端与移动端。</p>\n      <div class=\"platform-tags\">\n        <span class=\"platform-pill\">macOS</span>\n        <span class=\"platform-pill\">Windows</span>\n        <span class=\"platform-pill\">iOS</span>\n        <span class=\"platform-pill\">Android</span>\n        <span class=\"platform-pill\">Linux</span>\n        <span class=\"platform-pill\">路由器系统</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"faq\">\n    <div class=\"section-header\">\n      <p class=\"section-tag\">Questions</p>\n      <h2>常见答疑</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-sub\">关于配额、设备与订阅重置的说明。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-list\">\n      <details class=\"faq-item\">\n        <summary>每月流量何时完成重置？</summary>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          流量配额按账单周期结算。自订购之日起每满一个月自动重置流量，未用完流量不累计至下个周期。\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"faq-item\">\n        <summary>如何计算同时在线设备数？</summary>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          系统以同一时刻活跃连接的公网 IP 及设备标识为统计依据。超过套餐上限时新连接将暂时排队或中断。\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"faq-item\">\n        <summary>节点列表无法更新如何处理？</summary>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          请检查本地网络连通性。确认客户端订阅地址无多余空格，必要时开启“允许不安全证书”或更换分流测试节点。\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"faq-item\">\n        <summary>支持不同平台同时使用吗？</summary>\n        <div class=\"faq-content\">\n          支持。订阅链接可在多个已安装兼容客户端的设备中导入，只要并发在线数不超过方案额度即可。\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer>\n    <div>© 云画. 保留所有权利.</div>\n    <div>纯静态配置指引与参考文档</div>\n  </footer>\n</main>",
